// Settings panel translations.
"Lid angle" = "屏幕开合角度";
"This Mac has no lid angle sensor. Only some MacBook models have one." = "这台 Mac 没有屏幕开合角度传感器。只有部分 MacBook 机型配备该传感器。";
"Depth effect" = "景深效果";
"Leans the screen away as the lid closes." = "合上屏幕时，画面会向后倾斜。";
"Live rendering" = "实时渲染";
"Off holds the frame from when the effect started." = "关闭后，画面将停留在效果开始时的那一帧。";
"Start" = "触发设置";
"Timeout" = "超时";
"Ends the effect once the angle stops changing." = "角度不再变化时结束效果。";
"Start angle" = "起始角度";
"The effect starts at this angle." = "屏幕合至此角度时开始生效。";
"Full effect after" = "完全生效所需角度";
"Degrees of further closing to reach full strength." = "继续合上此角度后，效果达到最强。";
"Look" = "外观";
"Blur" = "模糊强度";
"Blur radius at the far edge." = "画面远端边缘的模糊半径。";
"Blur spread" = "模糊范围";
"0 blurs the far edge only, 100 the whole picture." = "0 仅模糊远端边缘，100 则模糊整个画面。";
"Dimming" = "变暗强度";
"How dark the far edge goes." = "画面远端边缘的变暗程度。";
"Dimming spread" = "变暗范围";
"Everything above this height goes fully dark." = "此高度以上的画面达到最大变暗强度。";
"Perspective" = "透视";
"Lean back" = "后倾幅度";
"Degrees of lean per degree of closing. 1 holds it still." = "每合上 1° 时画面的后倾角度。设为 1 时，画面在空间中保持不动。";
"0 keeps the sides parallel, 100 converges sharply." = "0 保持两侧平行，100 则使两侧明显向内收拢。";
"Show angle in menu bar" = "在菜单栏显示角度";
"Launch at login" = "登录时启动";
"Reset" = "重置";
"Quit" = "退出";
"Made by " = "作者：";
"Screen Recording permission is required to show the depth effect." = "需要屏幕录制权限才能显示景深效果。";
"Open System Settings" = "打开系统设置";
"Could not open System Settings. Open it manually and enable screen recording for Mac Duo under Privacy & Security." = "无法打开系统设置。请手动打开，在“隐私与安全性”中为 Mac Duo 开启屏幕录制权限。";
"Language" = "语言";
"System" = "跟随系统";
"Chinese (Simplified)" = "简体中文";
"Allow Mac Duo under Login Items & Extensions to finish turning this on." = "还需在「登录项与扩展」中允许 Mac Duo，此开关才真正生效。";
"Physical optics" = "物理光学";
"Takes the focus and the light from where the picture is, instead of a fixed gradient." = "按画面的实际位置计算对焦与受光，而不是套一条固定渐变。";
"How wide the lens opens. Larger throws the picture further out of focus." = "光圈开多大。越大，画面离焦越明显。";
"How much of the light the picture actually loses is applied." = "画面实际损失的光，按多大比例施加。";
"Strength" = "强度";
"How hard the blur and the dimming are pushed. The shape of the picture is solved from the lid and the display either way." = "模糊和压暗推到多狠。画面的形状无论如何都由开合角和显示器尺寸解算。";
"Viewing distance" = "观看距离";
"How far you sit from the screen. Too small and the picture leans away more than it should." = "你离屏幕多远。设小了，画面看起来会比实际后倾得更多。";
"Eye height" = "视线高度";
"How far your eyes are above the middle of the screen." = "你的眼睛高出屏幕中心多少。";
"Measure with camera" = "用摄像头测量";
"Measuring…" = "测量中…";
"Measured from %d frames." = "已从 %d 帧测得。";
"Calibrate" = "标定";
"Measure" = "测量";
"Calibrated at %.0f cm." = "已按 %.0f cm 标定。";
"Set the distance you are actually at, then Calibrate. The camera can measure it after that." = "先把距离调成你实际的位置，再点标定。之后摄像头就能自己测了。";
"Calibrate at %.0f cm" = "按 %.0f cm 标定";
"Sit back, the way you normally do…" = "坐回你平常的位置…";
"Remember where I sit" = "记住我现在的位置";
"Follow me" = "跟随我";
"Remembered. Move around and press Follow me." = "记住了。换个坐姿再点「跟随我」。";
"The camera will move the slider to match wherever you sit." = "相机会跟着你的位置自动调这个滑块。";
"Drag the slider until the picture stops leaning, then let the camera remember that. You never have to know the number." = "把滑块拖到画面不再后倾为止，然后让相机记住那一刻。你不需要知道这个数字是多少。";
"Drag until the picture stops leaning away. The number is where that puts your eyes; you do not have to measure it." = "拖到画面不再后倾为止。这个数字是推算出来的，你不用去量。";
